@apiMovies_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Get all auth
GET {{apiMovies_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth
Accept: application/json

### Get all categories
GET {{apiMovies_HostAddress}}/api/v1/category
Accept: application/json

### Get all Movies
GET {{apiMovies_HostAddress}}/api/v1/movie
Accept: application/json

### Get all Users
GET {{apiMovies_HostAddress}}/api/v1/user
Accept: application/json

### Get all Roles
GET {{apiMovies_HostAddress}}/api/v1/role
Accept: application/json

###